Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:01.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't tell what'll come tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:04.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}This is different than making a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Something about it is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:09.84,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And I don't think of it as some sort of forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:13.05,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}So I just don't get why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:16.51,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't quite wrap my head around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:22.52,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)\fscx90}but your existence is now much more than just important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:28.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}There's nothing in this world that doesn't come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:32.82,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I don't cry because I'm hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.49,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}They're the sweet, sweet drops of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:39.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to go on dreaming forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to try and be more gentle, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:45.87,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I can be with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.29,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Girls are really strong, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:52.71,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}But sometimes, they can be really weak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:59.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Our wishes are happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:02.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And our days will be just as happy!
