Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:44.09,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}A sunny Sunday's early afternoon;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:47.47,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:53.85,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}The same old road that I'm so used to walking on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:58.94,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...shines with a dazzling light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:03.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I have the warm sunlight shining down on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.87,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:19.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:24.09,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:29.30,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:34.52,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:40.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:44.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:50.45,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice swoops up and down with me.
