Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't go and pull disappearing acts like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It scares me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, pick a green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be safer if we hold hands while we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Safer for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want the blue one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since when were there so many parents with children here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Okay. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What size are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to be comparing it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit waving your arms around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pyjamas! Pants! Shirts! Socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've only put trousers in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't let us wear skirts to nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I completely forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Monday, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a little further. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you bunking off again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You good for nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always bringing me stuff I don't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to get mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean? Damn idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is the Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hello. I heard about your recent loss, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san? It's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I never asked for your mobile number.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you go about starting nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? You actually took Rin-chan home with you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean by "for now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it's too late for me to take the day off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's the procedure to enrol her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just enrol her right away, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you pull some strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure I'm the right person to be asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could start by asking someone at the city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, just something on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.78,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:36.94,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're talking about something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.81,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a temporary nursery for emergencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A temporary nursery for emergencies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:51.83,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, no, just something on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done in a minute. Just wait a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'm taking the miso soup off the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it sounds like you're pretty busy, so I'll call back la{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, hardly any results...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, suddenly I'm going to double my work commute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's pretty close, but I can't get out of work at six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.65,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sure. Let's play again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Bye bye, Reina-chan! See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks pretty good,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it says they'll only take kids on emergency notice for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The futon feels strangely warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, about the nursery you're going to today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.11,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elbows off the table while you eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery you're going to is only\Ntaking you on a temporary basis, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It means you'll go there until we can find a place to formally enrol you at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does "formally" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It means properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's slightly different...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, {\i1}my{\i0} hair's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P-Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it embarrassing for you to have other kids see me carrying you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please take good care of her, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We will. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to make it back while it's light,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll try to be as quick as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pinky promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I tell a lie, I'll absolutely swallow a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My finger was cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got the song wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you. Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Rin. I never thought about how you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You had no understanding of your mum's\Ncircumstances, nor of my granddad's lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You only knew the pain of being left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I was going to leave you behind, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure having that happen to you once...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is more than enough to last you a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Read this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, let's grab some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I've got something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got mine a little earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Then I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first day of the month and you're already in workaholic mode, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me a photo of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.35,0:12:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! There's a call for you on line four about the investors' inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go and get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? This is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done at work in just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery is... so far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so... sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, are those crisps? They look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chopped vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a thousand needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! You need to sign here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like it's actually likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but what if I find a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi. This was supposed to go out yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This really isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already apologised to the recipient, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'll call them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go for a few drinks. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, tonight's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something going on then, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I get it. Sounds like someone's getting lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Run away from the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:19:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's just no end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long can I keep living like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are Rin-chan's things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is all that she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother and child health record and\Nother important documents are here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only for a short while,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,raising a child is a terribly difficult job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Surely, Rin is the one who has it the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I'm just going to have a little look in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her mouth's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of the relatives talk about you\Nlike you're some sort of supervillain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder... Who's the real villain, Masako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Feeling sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you've decided to sleep over there aft{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.11,0:22:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.54,0:22:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? D-Did I...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.61,0:22:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.60,0:22:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.83,0:22:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat. Sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll change the sheets, so give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said that it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I agreed!
